      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "Another look at two girls practising kayaking on the river. These are members of the Ottawa River Runners (ORR), which is a whitewater kayak and canoe club located on the Ottawa River in Ottawa, Canada. The club is located at the Fleet Street Pumping Station tailrace, in the Lebreton Flats area of Ottawa. The whitewater course that the ORR established and maintains is called The Pumphouse.(Ottawa, Canada, June 2015)",
